      "content": "my toddler has been vomiting all night and won't take much water... he's super sleepy and hasn't peed in like 6 hours. i dont want to take him to the er if i dont have to but i'm worried about him getting dehydrated. i have some salt tablets in the cabinet from my hiking trips, can i just crush a little bit into his juice or something to help him hold onto more fluids?",
